  "decision_conditions": [
    "The\r\nexisting front boundary wall, by reason of its solid appearance and inappropriate\r\nsuburban brick design together with its significant height, appears as an incongruous,\r\nbulky and visually obtrusive addition to the street scene given its prominent\r\nposition on the junction of Mountbel Road and Kenton Lane,&amp;nbsp; conflicts with\r\nthe prevailing pattern of development and is therefore contrary to the high quality design\r\naspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), and D3 (D.1 and\r\nD.11) of The London Plan (2021), Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan 2013."
